 control of his car in the curves before Poble Espanyol.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Zanelli, not satisfied with the Nacional Pescara, obviously made a last minute decision to race his Monza instead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":0,"text":"The cars line up by their drawn race numbers and are ready to go about 11 a.m.","q":false},{"lap":0,"text":"With just five minutes remaining of the practice session DePaolo lost control of his car in the curves before Poble Espanyol.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi"},{"lap":0,"text":"Zanelli, not satisfied with the Nacional Pescara, obviously made a last minute decision to race his Monza instead.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":0,"text":"The cars line up by their drawn race numbers and are ready to go about 11 a.m.","q":false},{"lap":1,"text":"Nuvolari leads the first lap from the Ferraris of Chiron, Varzi and Lehoux; Hamilton, already in trouble, pits.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":1,"text":"Hamilton, already in trouble with his Maserati, came in to the pit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":1,"text":"Nuvolari leads the first lap from the Ferraris of Chiron, Varzi and Lehoux; Hamilton, already in trouble, pits.","q":false,"c":7},{"lap":1,"text":"Hamilton, already in trouble with his Maserati, came in to the pit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap Chiron passed Nuvolari to take the lead of the race. They were followed by Varzi, Lehoux and the others.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":2,"text":"On the second lap Chiron passed Nuvolari to take the lead of the race. They were followed by Varzi, Lehoux and the others.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":4,"text":"Nuvolari's injured leg was already giving him pain and after a brave fight he was forced to let the Ferrari duo of Varzi and Lehoux by on lap four.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":4,"text":"Nuvolari's injured leg was already giving him pain and after a brave fight he was forced to let the Ferrari duo of Varzi and Lehoux by on lap four.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":5,"text":"Zanelli had to make a pit stop after four laps for adjustments and was back in the pit again a lap later. Tort also had to make a pit stop.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":5,"text":"Zanelli had to make a pit stop after four laps for adjustments and was back in the pit again a lap later. Tort also had to make a pit stop.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":3},{"lap":8,"text":"Chiron opens a small gap with a 2m08s eighth lap.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":8,"text":"Chiron opens a small gap with a 2m08s eighth lap.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":9,"text":"Varzi answers with a 2m08s lap of his own to catch Chiron; Tort retires the Nacional Pescara.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":9,"text":"Varzi answers with a 2m08s lap of his own to catch Chiron; Tort retires the Nacional Pescara.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":11,"text":"After 11 laps Hamilton, after having done a new pit stop, retired the oil leaking Whitney Straight Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":11,"text":"After 11 laps Hamilton, after having done a new pit stop, retired the oil leaking Whitney Straight Maserati.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":10},{"lap":14,"text":"After 14 laps Nuvolari stopped in the box for 2m15s to refuel and to adjust the spark plugs, returning to the race in seventh position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":14,"text":"After 14 laps Nuvolari stopped in the box for 2m15s to refuel and to adjust the spark plugs, returning to the race in seventh position.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":18,"text":"After 18 laps \"Delmo\" retired his Bugatti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":18,"text":"After 18 laps \"Delmo\" retired his Bugatti.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":9},{"lap":19,"text":"On the 19th lap Varzi took over the lead from his team mate Chiron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":19,"text":"On the 19th lap Varzi took over the lead from his team mate Chiron.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":23,"text":"On the 23rd lap there was an incident when Villapadierna spun his Maserati 180\u00b0 at the turn before the grandstand in front of Lehoux with Nuvolari following right behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":23,"text":"Nuvolari had climbed back to fourth position, having passed Brunet, Palacio and Falchetto.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":23,"text":"On the 23rd lap there was an incident when Villapadierna spun his Maserati 180\u00b0 at the turn before the grandstand in front of Lehoux with Nuvolari following right behind.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":6},{"lap":23,"text":"Nuvolari had climbed back to fourth position, having passed Brunet, Palacio and Falchetto.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":29,"text":"On lap 29 the miserable weekend for Ecurie Braillard ended when Falchetto after having done a good race gave up as he was feeling ill.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":29,"text":"On lap 29 the miserable weekend for Ecurie Braillard ended when Falchetto after having done a good race gave up as he was feeling ill.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":8},{"lap":32,"text":"After 32 laps Nuvolari gave up with this leg in bad shape. That gave Palacio fourth position behind the three Ferrari Alfas.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":32,"text":"After 32 laps Nuvolari gave up with this leg in bad shape. That gave Palacio fourth position behind the three Ferrari Alfas.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":7},{"lap":33,"text":"Varzi was pulling away doing 2m12s laps against 2m14s laps for Chiron with Lehoux in third position holding Varzi's speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":33,"text":"Varzi was pulling away doing 2m12s laps against 2m14s laps for Chiron with Lehoux in third position holding Varzi's speed.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":35,"text":"The rest of the field, lapping at 2m20s or slower, is lapped for the second time.","q":false},{"lap":35,"text":"The rest of the field, lapping at 2m20s or slower, is lapped for the second time.","q":false},{"lap":40,"text":"During the next laps Varzi continued even faster doing laps around 2m10s against his team mates' 2m13-2.14s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":40,"text":"During the next laps Varzi continued even faster doing laps around 2m10s against his team mates' 2m13-2.14s","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Varzi now has a lead of a minute and a half.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":50,"text":"Varzi now has a lead of a minute and a half.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"With ten laps to go Varzi's lead over Chiron is still 1m21s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"With ten laps to go Varzi's lead over Chiron is still 1m21s.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"Varzi leads the Ferrari trio home, all three having lapped the rest of the field three times.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":70,"text":"Varzi leads the Ferrari trio home, all three having lapped the rest of the field three times.","q":false,"c":0}]}